### Anatomical 3D Models & Data Attribution (CC BY-SA 4.0)

The anatomical 3D assets located in `dist/models/` are derived from the **Z-Anatomy** open-source atlas:
- Source: Z-Anatomy (SkeletalSystem100.fbx, MuscularSystem100.fbx, NervousSystem100.fbx)
  Author: Lluís Vinent Juanico, Gauthier Kervyn and Z-Anatomy contributors.
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).
  URL: https://github.com/LluisV/Z-Anatomy / https://www.z-anatomy.net/
- Upstream anatomical databases:
  - BodyParts3D (The Database Center for Life Science) — CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan / CC BY 4.0.
  - "Cranial Nerves and Foramina" — University of Dundee, CAHID — CC BY 4.0.

In compliance with the CC BY-SA 4.0 ShareAlike terms, all optimized and adapted 3D mesh files (`dist/models/*.glb`) and their catalog metadata are distributed under the **CC BY-SA 4.0** license.

See `dist/models/ATTRIBUTION.md` and `dist/models/SOURCE-LICENSE.txt` for complete legal details, conversion provenance, and source checksums.

